    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23031" root="شمعل" body-key="$">
    
      Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَمْعَلَ</span></b> , (O, K, TA, [in the CK <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَشَمْعَلَ</span>,])
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَمْعَلَةٌ</span>, (TA,) <i>It became scattered</i> or <i>dispersed.</i> (O, K, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَمْعَلَةٌ</span> signifies The
<i>reading,</i> or <i>reciting,</i> of the Jews, (S, O, K, TA,)
<i>when they assemble</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فى مهرهم</span>: (TA: [but I
know not what this means:]) one says of them
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَمْعَلَت</span> [i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَمْعَلَتِ اليَهُودُ</span>]. (TA.)

